=========================Deployment===============
1. SSH into AWS EC2 and clone the git repos 
2. Create /data/db and /data/sunbeam/ml
3. Change permissions to 777 on ml 
4. Run ./start.sh inside sunbeamJS/sunbeam-app 
5. Run ./start.sh inside sunbeam flask directory 
6. Make sure the containers don't die when ssh terminates


==========Security=================
The endpoints may not be direactly reachable outside of the frontend but 
that doesn't mean its unreachable. Anyone who can trace the route of the request 
through the client can figure out where the backend is hosted. They may be able 
to query the backend endpoint directly. Need to secure this by disabling requests 
to the backend from all other IPs, except its own IP.




